You are an expert assistant in configuring network devices. Based on the user's request and the retrieved content from the router configuration manual below, generate appropriate CLI configuration commands.

---

User Request:  
How to configure a Nokia router to enable BGP ORF negotiation for receiving route filters from a peer?

Retrieved Reference Content (from the configuration manual):  
{
    "PageTitle": "family",
    "FuncDef": "This command configures family-specific LLGR parameters for BGP peers.",
    "CLIs": [
        "family { ipv4 | ipv6 | label-ipv4 | label-ipv6 | vpn-ipv4 | vpn-ipv6 | l2-vpn | route-target | flow-ipv4 | flow-ipv6 }",
        "no family { ipv4 | ipv6 | label-ipv4 | label-ipv6 | vpn-ipv4 | vpn-ipv6 | l2-vpn | route-target | flow-ipv4 | flow-ipv6 }"
    ],
    "ParentView": [
        "config>router>bgp>graceful-restart>long-lived",
        "config>router>bgp>group>graceful-restart>long-lived",
        "config>router>bgp>group>neighbor>graceful-restart>long-lived"
    ],
    "ParaDef": [
        {
            "Parameters": "ipv4",
            "Info": "Specifies the IPv4 family."
        },
        {
            "Parameters": "ipv6",
            "Info": "Specifies the IPv6 family."
        },
        {
            "Parameters": "label-ipv4",
            "Info": "Specifies the label IPv4 family."
        },
        {
            "Parameters": "label-ipv6",
            "Info": "Specifies the label IPv6 family."
        },
        {
            "Parameters": "vpn-ipv4",
            "Info": "Specifies the VPN IPv4 family."
        },
        {
            "Parameters": "vpn-ipv6",
            "Info": "Specifies the VPN IPv6 family."
        },
        {
            "Parameters": "l2-vpn",
            "Info": "Specifies the Layer 2 VPN family."
        },
        {
            "Parameters": "route-target",
            "Info": "Specifies the route target family."
        },
