How to configure Nokia routers to advertise IPv6 multicast routes from a VPRN over the provider network using BGP?
---
## Proposed answer:
{
  "commands": [
    "config>router>bgp>family vpn-ipv6",
    "config>router>bgp>group neighbor advertise-ipv6-next-hops vpn-ipv6",
    "config>router>bgp>group neighbor next-hop-self"
  ]
}
---
