## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
ignore-router-id include-internal <family> [ <family> ]
[ no ] ignore-router-id
FuncDef:
When theignore-router-idcommand is present, and the current best path to a destination was learned from EBGP peer X with BGP identifier x and a new path is received from EBGP peer Y with BGP identifier y, the best path remains unchanged if the new path is equivalent to the current best path up to the BGP identifier comparison - even if y is less than x.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'family', 'Info': 'Specifies up to two internal families to be included in this configuration. Values-mvpn-ipv4, mvpn-ipv6.'}
