ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'send-limit', 'Info': 'Specifies the maximum number of paths per multicast IPv4 VPN prefix that are allowed to be advertised to add-paths peers. The actual number of advertised routes may be less. If the value is none, the router does not negotiate the send capability with respect to multicast IPv4 VPN AFI/SAFI. Values-1 to 16, none.'}
{'Parameters': 'receive', 'Info': 'Specifies that the router negotiates to receive multiple multicast routes per IPv4 VPN prefix.'}
{'Parameters': 'none', 'Info': 'Specifies that the router does not negotiate to receive multiple multicast routes per IPv4 VPN prefix.'}
