    "PageTitle": "reflect between-clients (BGP IPv6 SR-Policy address family view)",
    "FuncDef": "The reflect between-clients command enables route reflection among clients through the RR.\nThe undo reflect between-clients command disables route reflection among clients through the RR.\nBy default, route reflection among clients through the RR is enabled.",
    "CLIs": [
