---
## User question:
Configure Nokia router to set the maximum interval between SPF calculations to 120 seconds, with initial delay of 10 seconds and secondary delay of 30 seconds under BGP optimal route reflection.
---
## Proposed answer:
{
  "commands": [
    "config>router>bgp:bgp",
    "config>router>bgp>group>graceful-restart>long-lived:family { label-ipv4 | label-ipv6 }:initial-send-delay-zero 10",
    "config>router>bgp>group>graceful-restart>long-lived:family { label-ipv4 | label-ipv6 }:hold-time 120",
